  "plain": "A Navy fighter pilot named Ryan Graves says that when he went public in 2019 about unidentified objects seen by pilots, he did it only because his fellow aviators kept reporting them and getting no answers. He tells it about himself: \"I did it simply because I was hearing that my colleagues were having no resolution to this issue.\" It frames his coming forward as a matter of flight safety and duty rather than publicity."
